Lyrics Sync third-party notices
===============================

This file is part of the application distribution. Include the corresponding
license text and source offer for every binary and Python dependency shipped.

FFmpeg
------
No FFmpeg binary is currently included in this repository. Before release, use
a verified LGPL build of ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe with neither --enable-gpl
nor --enable-nonfree. Record the exact build version, configuration, source URL,
SHA-256, license text, and a download location for the corresponding source.
FFmpeg licensing guidance:
https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

Chromaprint fpcalc
------------------
No fpcalc binary is currently included in this repository. Before release,
record the Chromaprint version, source URL, SHA-256, selected FFT backend, and
the applicable license text. Do not build with a GPL FFT backend if distributing
under a non-GPL configuration. Project documentation:
https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint

Python packages
---------------
The frozen backend includes third-party Python packages. Generate and review
the package license inventory from the exact release environment and include
the license texts and source links before publishing a release.
